import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalPage title="Restaurant Offers Disclaimer" heading="Restaurant offers disclaimer" path="/disclaimer" description="Restaurant offers change. Please confirm prices and availability with venues. Destination : Brunch is an independent guide publisher.">
  <h2>Offers change</h2>
  <p>Brunches, happy hours, business lunches and other offers are set by the venues themselves. Venues can change or withdraw prices, packages, menus, timings and conditions at any time, often without notice, for example during holidays, special events or Ramadan.</p>

  <h2>Always confirm with the venue</h2>
  <p>Each guide shows when its information was last checked. Before you go or book, please confirm prices, availability, age limits, dress codes and booking conditions directly with the venue.</p>

  <h2>Independent publisher</h2>
  <p>{SITE.name} is an independent guide publisher. Unless a guide clearly says otherwise, we have no partnership with, and are not paid or endorsed by, any venue, hotel, restaurant group or deals app mentioned. Venue names and trademarks belong to their owners.</p>

  <h2>Payments and delivery</h2>
  <p>Payments and delivery of guides are handled by Gumroad. We do not take bookings or payments for venues.</p>

  <h2>Alcohol</h2>
  <p>Where guides mention drinks packages, these are only listed in places where they are legal, and only for people of legal drinking age. Guides for places where alcohol is not served, such as Saudi Arabia, contain no alcohol offers. Please drink responsibly and follow local laws.</p>

  <h2>Ratings</h2>
  <p>Where a guide shows its own scores (such as value, food or fun), these are our editorial opinions to help you compare options. They are not customer ratings.</p>
</LegalPage>
